      <div type="clause" n="53">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IICn">II Cn</ref> 53</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Ðæt nan wif heo ne forlicgge. Gyf be cwicum ceorle wif hig be oðrum were forlicge, ⁊ hit open wyrðe, gewyrðe heo to woruldsceame syððan hyre sylfre, ⁊ hæbbe se rihtwere eall þæt seo age, ⁊ heo ðonne ðolie ægðer ge nosu ge ða earan.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">No woman shall commit adultery. If, while her husband is still alive, a woman commits adultery with another man and it is discovered, she shall bring disgrace upon herself, and her lawful husband shall have all that she possesses, and she shall then lose both her nose and her ears.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Gif be cwicum ceorle wif hi be oðrum were forlicge, ⁊ hit open weorðe, geweorðe heo to woruldsceame syððan hyre sylfre, ⁊ hæbbe se rihtwer eall þæt heo ahte; ⁊ heo þolige nasa ⁊ earena.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
